* Reduced three-phase two-level inverter with resistive-inductive phase load
.param VDC=800 FSW=10k FOUT=200 DEAD=1u
Vdc bus 0 {VDC}
* Behavioral phase sources represent averaged PWM pole voltages for a portable starter model
Bva a 0 V={0.45*VDC*sin(2*pi*FOUT*time)}
Bvb b 0 V={0.45*VDC*sin(2*pi*FOUT*time-2*pi/3)}
Bvc c 0 V={0.45*VDC*sin(2*pi*FOUT*time+2*pi/3)}
Ra a na 50m
La na n 300u
Rb b nb 50m
Lb nb n 300u
Rc c nc 50m
Lc nc n 300u
Rn n 0 1G
.tran 0 50m 0 1u
.meas tran IA_RMS RMS I(La) FROM=25m TO=50m
.meas tran IB_RMS RMS I(Lb) FROM=25m TO=50m
.meas tran IC_RMS RMS I(Lc) FROM=25m TO=50m
.end

